  message: "Follow-up filed as INV-rolok: python instantiates edges point at the class (8,919 of 11,260 in hypergumbo own graph), class nodes have no traversable out-edges, so construction confers no reachability there. That item carries the full measurement and three unjudged options (re-point dst / linker-minted class-to-init edge / rule it ruby+csharp-only). It also records the honest sizing: the immediate dead-code win is ZERO because 0 of 2,152 dead candidates are __init__, so the cost is a latent recall hole rather than present false positives -- size it on the prospector corpus before picking an option."  # 347f
